<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE -- Jefferson County, Ky..</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE -- Jefferson County, Ky..</headline>
<text>
<p>COUNTY OF JEFFERSON, KENTUCKY</p>
<p>RE: $87,115,000</p>
<p>HEALTH FACILITIES REVENUE BONDS, SERIES 1997</p>
<p>(UNIVERSITY MEDICAL CENTER, INC. PROJECT)</p>
<p>Effective at 3:00 P.M. E.D.T., Wednesday, July 2, 1997</p>
